mentation), and reduced **availability** (traffic blackholes or lockouts).\",\n  \"referencias\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Remediation\",\n      \"url\": \"https://hub.prowler.com/check/cloudwatch_changes_to_network_acls_alarm_configured\"\n    }\n  ]\n}', '2026-08-26 15:43:22', 'prowler_web', '2026-08-26 15:43:22', 1),
