\"2.10.2\",\n      \"2.11.3\"\n    ],\n    \"FedRAMP-20x-KSI-Low-25.05C\": [\n      \"ksi-cmt\"\n    ],\n    \"AWS-AI-Security-Framework-1.0\": [\n      \"AISF-DETECT-05\"\n    ],\n    \"AWS-Well-Architected-Framework-Security-Pillar\": [\n      \"SEC04-BP04\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"remediation\": \"Create a metric filter for IAM policy create/update/delete and attach/detach events with an **alarm** to notify responders.\\n- Enforce **least privilege** and separation of duties for policy changes\\n- Require approvals and central logging across Regions/accounts\\n- Integrate alerts with incident response\",\n  \"remediation_url\": \"https://hub.prowler.com/check/cloudwatch_log_metric_filter_policy_changes\",\n  \"risk_details\": \"Absent alerting on **IAM policy changes**, privilege modifications can go unnoticed, enabling **privilege escalation**, hidden backdoors, or permission revocations. This threatens **confidentiality** and **integrity**, and may impact **availability** if critical access is removed or misconfigured.\",\n  \"referencias\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Remediation\",\n      \"url\": \"https://hub.prowler.com/check/cloudwatch_log_metric_filter_policy_changes\"\n    }\n  ]\n}', '2026-08-26 15:43:22', 'prowler_web', '2026-08-26 15:43:22', 1),
