access** where trusts allow. This jeopardizes **confidentiality** and **integrity** of data and the control plane.\",\n  \"referencias\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Remediation\",\n      \"url\": \"https://hub.prowler.com/check/iam_no_custom_policy_permissive_role_assumption\"\n    }\n  ]\n}', '2026-08-26 15:43:22', 'prowler_web', '2026-08-26 15:43:22', 1),
