sign permissions to **groups** (humans) and **roles** (workloads); avoid user-attached policies. Enforce **least privilege**, prefer federation and temporary credentials, and use tags or **permissions boundaries** to constrain scope. Review regularly to remove direct user policies and right-size access.\",\n  \"remediation_url\": \"https://hub.prowler.com/check/iam_policy_attached_only_to_group_or_roles\",\n  \"risk_details\": \"Directly attached user policies hinder centralized control and cause privilege creep. If a user is compromised, excessive rights enable data exposure, resource tampering, and lateral movement, harming **confidentiality** and **integrity**. Revocation is error-prone, weakening **separation of duties** and auditability.\",\n  \"referencias\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Remediation\",\n      \"url\": \"https://hub.prowler.com/check/iam_policy_attached_only_to_group_or_roles\"\n    }\n  ]\n}', '2026-08-26 15:43:22', 'prowler_web', '2026-08-26 15:43:22', 1),
(324, 20, 1, NULL, 314, 'iam_policy_no_full_access_to_cloudtrail', 'aws', 'iam', 'arn:aws:iam::601227218666:policy/fn4-exploitableNotAction', 'eu-west-1', 3, 1, NULL, 'NO', '{\n  \"status_code\": \"FAIL\",\n  \"account_id\": \"601227218666\"\n}', '{\n  \"compliance\": {\n    \"NIS2\": [\n      \"11.2.2.a\"\n    ],\n    \"SOC2\": [\n      \"cc_3_3\"\n    ],\n    \"C5-2025\": [\n      \"IAM-10.01B\",\n      \"SIM-03.07B\"\n    ],\n    \"ENS-RD2022\": [\n      \"op.exp.8.r4.aws.ct.1\"\n    ],\n    \"CCC-v2025.10\": [\n      \"CCC.Core.CN05.AR01\",\n      \"CCC.Core.CN05.AR02\",\n      \"CCC.Core.CN05.AR04\",\n      \"CCC.IAM.CN04.AR01\"\n    ],\n    \"MITRE-ATTACK\": [\n      \"T1078\",\n      \"T1648\",\n      \"T1098\",\n      \"T1578\",\n      \"T1550\",\n      \"T1580\"\n    ],\n    \"NIST-CSF-2.0\": [\n      \"rr_1\",\n      \"po_1\",\n      \"ac_1\",\n      \"ac_4\"\n    ],\n    \"KISA-ISMS-P-2023\": [\n      \"2.5.1\",\n      \"2.5.5\",\n      \"2.5.6\",\n      \"2.10.2\"\n    ],\n    \"KISA-ISMS-P-2023-korean\": [\n      \"2.5.1\",\n      \"2.5.5\",\n      \"2.5.6\",\n      \"2.10.2\"\n    ],\n    \"FedRAMP-20x-KSI-Low-25.05C\": [\n      \"ksi-iam\"\n    ],\n    \"ASD-Essential-Eight-Nov 2023\": [\n      \"E8-4.4\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"remediation\": \"Apply **least privilege**: avoid `cloudtrail:*` and allow only required actions.\\n\\nEnforce **separation of duties** for trail management. Use **permissions boundaries** or **SCPs** to block broad CloudTrail access, and validate policies regularly to refine scopes.\",\n  \"remediation_url\": \"https://hub.prowler.com/check/iam_policy_no_full_access_to_cloudtrail\",\n  \"risk_details\": \"Unrestricted CloudTrail control lets principals stop or alter logging, delete or modify trails, and query events.\\n\\nThis enables log evasion, audit tampering, and reconnaissance, undermining the **integrity**, **availability**, and **confidentiality** of audit evidence and detection.\",\n  \"referencias\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Remediation\",\n      \"url\": \"https://hub.prowler.com/check/iam_policy_no_full_access_to_cloudtrail\"\n    }\n  ]\n}', '2026-08-26 15:43:22', 'prowler_web', '2026-08-26 15:43:22', 1),
